Subject: [PATCH] Sisong 2.16-6: completion opens as you type . -> and ::

Typing "thing." or "thing->" or "Class::" in a C or C++ document opens
the completion list by itself with the members clangd knows, and letters
typed while it is open narrow it; "3." opens nothing. A C or C++
document goes to clangd_server when it is opened, brought to the front
and saved, so clangd's diagnostics reach the message pane unasked and
the server is running before the first completion is wanted. ProseApps
eefd78e.

